Examples:
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","content":"Create a replacement credential, then restart the service.","questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Rotating the credential requires restarting the service."}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","source":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"The source requires restarting."}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","resources":{"docs":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"docs/*.md"}}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"The document requires restarting."}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{"queries":[{"operation":"models"}]}'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"sections","resources":{"file":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"The target requires restarting."}}}]
  }'

Input: {"queries":[…]} for fresh calls, optionally with "responseChars" (the size of each response page; the rest pages, nothing dropped; local walk rows still page at the automatic window); copy {"cursor":"…"} from a continuation.
Up to 5 queries per call.

Required fields, by operation:
  evaluate  operation, content
  evaluate  operation, source
  evaluate  operation, resources
  models    operation
  sections  operation, resources, questions

Each form's example: octocode schema clasify --view variants

Fields: octocode schema clasify

